## Chapter 4 Results

In this chapter, we present the measurements of \(v_{2}\) at mid-rapidity \(|Y|<1\) (\(|\eta|<1\) for charged hadrons) from Cu+Cu and Au+Au collisions. \(v_{2}\) results are presented for strange hadrons (\(K^{0}_{S}\), \(\Lambda\) and \(\Xi\)) in Cu+Cu collisions at \(\sqrt{s_{NN}}\) = 200 GeV, for charged hadrons in Cu+Cu collisions at \(\sqrt{s_{NN}}\) = 200 and 62.4 GeV, for \(\pi\), \(p\), \(K^{0}_{S}\), \(\Lambda\), \(\phi\), \(\Xi\) and \(\Omega\) in Au+Au collisions at \(\sqrt{s_{NN}}\) = 200 GeV, for charged hadrons in Au+Au collisions at \(\sqrt{s_{NN}}\) = 9.2 GeV.

